      "writtenOn": "2013-08-29T17:10:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that if the module requires a higher system clock speed than the current system clock speed, the entire system clock will be increased to allow the module to operate.\n\nWhen a module is disabled, the system clock will be reduced to the highest clock required by the remaining enabled modules.",
      "revId": "d3bf01e44d83933007bd1dc47b662619626a379a",
